# Generated figures, tables and value dumps. Everything under figures/out/ is
# produced by the scripts in figures/ and is deliberately not version-controlled
# — the one exception is cobra_input.csv, which is the hand-off file to the EPA
# COBRA model and cannot be regenerated without it.
figures/out/*
!figures/out/cobra_input.csv

# Julia
*.jl.cov
*.jl.*.cov
*.jl.mem

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*

# Editors / temporary files
.vscode/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
*.log
